v><button data-slot="button" data-variant="ghost" data-size="icon-sm" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium focus-visible:ring-1 aria-invalid:ring-1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none group/button select-none hover:text-foreground dark:hover:bg-muted/50 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground size-7 shrink-0 rounded-md border border-transparent hover:border-border/60 hover:bg-muted/50" type="button" aria-label="Copy config path"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></aside><section id="changelog" class="scroll-mt-24 glass-card-static min-w-0 rounded-2xl border lg:col-start-1"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-muted/30"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted-foreground/80 mb-0">What&#x27;s new</h3><span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold text-muted-foreground">5<!-- --> release<!-- -->s</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-chevron-down size-4 text-muted-foreground transition-transform rotate-180"><path d="M6 9l6 6l6 -6"></path></svg></button><div class="px-5 pb-5"><p class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-muted/40 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-info-circle mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 opacity-70" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0a9 9 0 0 0 -18 0"></path><path d="M12 9h.01"></path><path d="M11 12h1v4h1"></path></svg><span>These are the upstream project&#x27;s releases. The newest release shown here may differ from the version the script actually installs, which can be pinned for stability.</span></p><div class="relative min-w-0 space-y-6 pl-5 before:absolute before:left-[7px] before:top-1 before:h-[calc(100%-1.25rem)] before:w-px before:bg-border"><div class="relative min-w-0"><span class="absolute -left-[21px] top-[9px] size-3 rounded-full border-2 bg-background border-primary shadow-[0_0_0_3px_hsl(var(--primary)/0.15)]"></span><div class="mb-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.1-rc0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-tag size-3.5 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 7.5a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0"></path><path d="M3 6v5.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l7.71 7.71a2.41 2.41 0 0 0 3.408 0l5.592 -5.592a2.41 2.41 0 0 0 0 -3.408l-7.71 -7.71a2 2 0 0 0 -1.414 -.586h-5.172a3 3 0 0 0 -3 3"></path></svg>v0.35.1-rc0</a><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground" title="September 29, 2026">2 days ago</span></div><div class="relative min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 rounded-lg bg-muted/30 px-3.5 py-2.5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none break-words prose-p:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:bg-muted/50 [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_pre]:overflow-x-auto [&amp;_code]:break-all max-h-48 overflow-hidden"><h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>feat: allow ten web searches per response by @ParthSareen in <a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602</a></li>
<li>MLX: version bump by @dhiltgen in <a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651</a></li>
<li>llama.cpp: version bump b11232 by @dhiltgen in <a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18652">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18652</a></li>
<li>create: support explicit model capabilities by @dhiltgen in <a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18708">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18708</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.35.0...v0.35.1-rc0">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.35.0...v0.35.1-rc0</a></p></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-14 rounded-b-lg bg-gradient-to-t from-muted/50 via-muted/12 to-transparent dark:from-muted/45 dark:via-muted/18 dark:to-transparent"></div><button type="button" class="relative z-10 my-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 pl-3.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary/80">Read more</button></div></div><div class="relative min-w-0"><span class="absolute -left-[21px] top-[9px] size-3 rounded-full border-2 bg-background border-muted-foreground/30"></span><div class="mb-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><a href="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-tag size-3.5 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 7.5a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 1 0 -2 0"></path><path d="M3 6v5.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l7.71 7.71a2.41 2.41 0 0 0 3.408 0l5.592 -5.592a2.41 2.41 0 0 0 0 -3.408l-7.71 -7.71a2 2 0 0 0 -1.414 -.586h-5.172a3 3 0 0 0 -3 3"></path></svg>v0.35.0</a><span class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.625rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary">Latest</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground" title="September 28, 2026">3 days ago</span></div><div class="relative min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 rounded-lg bg-muted/30 px-3.5 py-2.5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] prose prose-sm dark:prose-invert max-w-none break-words prose-p:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_code]:rounded [&amp;_code]:bg-muted/50 [&amp;_code]:px-1 [&amp;_pre]:overflow-x-auto [&amp;_code]:break-all max-h-48 overflow-hidden"><h2>Decision models</h2>
<p>Ollama now supports decision models through <code>/v1/systemone</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ml-1 align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button>, based on <a href="https://typesafe.ai">TypeSafe’s Jev API</a>.</p>
<p>Decision models return choices, probabilities, and scores instead of text. Use them for tasks such as ticket triage, model routing, and content classification.</p>
<p>Available models:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://ollama.com/library/nimble"><strong>Nimble</strong></a> from Bespoke Labs</li>
<li><a href="https://ollama.com/library/tev1"><strong>Tev1</strong></a> from Together AI</li>
</ul>
<div class="relative"><pre><code class="language-sh">ollama pull nimble
</code></pre><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring absolute right-1.5 top-1.5 bg-muted/60 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button></div>
<p>Send context and one or more questions:</p>
<div class="relative"><pre><code class="language-sh">curl http://localhost:11434/v1/systemone \
  -H &#x27;Content-Type: application/json&#x27; \
  -d &#x27;{
    &quot;model&quot;: &quot;nimble&quot;,
    &quot;state&quot;: &quot;Our checkout has returned 500 errors since 9am.&quot;,
    &quot;questions&quot;: {
      &quot;label&quot;: {
        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;choice&quot;,
        &quot;instructions&quot;: &quot;Which label fits this ticket?&quot;,
        &quot;criteria&quot;: {
          &quot;billing&quot;: &quot;Payments and refunds&quot;,
          &quot;bug&quot;: &quot;Software errors&quot;,
          &quot;account&quot;: &quot;Login and account access&quot;
        }
      }
    }
  }&#x27;
</code></pre><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring absolute right-1.5 top-1.5 bg-muted/60 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button></div>
<p>Example response:</p>
<div class="relative"><pre><code class="language-json">{
  &quot;model&quot;: &quot;nimble&quot;,
  &quot;answers&quot;: {
    &quot;label&quot;: {
      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;choice&quot;,
      &quot;choice&quot;: &quot;bug&quot;,
      &quot;probabilities&quot;: {
        &quot;billing&quot;: 0.0125,
        &quot;bug&quot;: 0.9781,
        &quot;account&quot;: 0.0093
      },
      &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.8906
    }
  },
  &quot;usage&quot;: {
    &quot;input_tokens&quot;: 174,
    &quot;output_tokens&quot;: 1
  }
}
</code></pre><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring absolute right-1.5 top-1.5 bg-muted/60 backdrop-blur-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button></div>
<p>The API supports three question types:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>choice</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ml-1 align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button>: Select an option and return probabilities for each.</li>
<li><code>noul</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ml-1 align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button>: Return the probability that a condition is true.</li>
<li><code>score</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ml-1 align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button>: Return a score across an ordered set of criteria</li>
</ul>
<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>Settings now opens without waiting for model discovery.</li>
<li>Fixed the macOS update menu and icon not reflecting an available update at startup.</li>
<li>Fixed stalled MLX model downloads hanging indefinitely.</li>
<li>Requests containing the deprecated <code>typical_p</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" title="Copy to clipboard" class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center rounded p-0.5 text-muted-foreground opacity-70 transition hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ml-1 align-middle"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9.667a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 -2.667h8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 2.667 2.667v8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 2.667h-8.666a2.667 2.667 0 0 1 -2.667 -2.667l0 -8.666"></path><path d="M4.012 16.737a2.005 2.005 0 0 1 -1.012 -1.737v-10c0 -1.1 .9 -2 2 -2h10c.75 0 1.158 .385 1.5 1"></path></svg></button> parameter now log a warning instead of failing.</li>
</ul>
