ath d="M19 18l1 0"></path></svg></button><a href="https://github.com/community-scripts/ProxmoxVE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hidden size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-foreground hover:text-foreground lg:flex" aria-label="GitHub"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-brand-github size-[18px]"><path d="M9 19c-4.3 1.4 -4.3 -2.5 -6 -3m12 5v-3.5c0 -1 .1 -1.4 -.5 -2c2.8 -.3 5.5 -1.4 5.5 -6a4.6 4.6 0 0 0 -1.3 -3.2a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 -.1 -3.2s-1.1 -.3 -3.5 1.3a12.3 12.3 0 0 0 -6.2 0c-2.4 -1.6 -3.5 -1.3 -3.5 -1.3a4.2 4.2 0 0 0 -.1 3.2a4.6 4.6 0 0 0 -1.3 3.2c0 4.6 2.7 5.7 5.5 6c-.6 .6 -.6 1.2 -.5 2v3.5"></path></svg></a><a href="https://discord.gg/3AnUqsXnmK" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hidden size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-foreground hover:text-foreground lg:flex" aria-label="Discord"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-brand-discord size-[18px]"><path d="M8 12a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 0 0 -2 0"></path><path d="M14 12a1 1 0 1 0 2 0a1 1 0 0 0 -2 0"></path><path d="M15.5 17c0 1 1.5 3 2 3c1.5 0 2.833 -1.667 3.5 -3c.667 -1.667 .5 -5.833 -1.5 -11.5c-1.457 -1.015 -3 -1.34 -4.5 -1.5l-.972 1.923a11.913 11.913 0 0 0 -4.053 0l-.975 -1.923c-1.5 .16 -3.043 .485 -4.5 1.5c-2 5.667 -2.167 9.833 -1.5 11.5c.667 1.333 2 3 3.5 3c.5 0 2 -2 2 -3"></path><path d="M7 16.5c3.5 1 6.5 1 10 0"></path></svg></a><a class="hidden size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-[#FF5E5B]/30 bg-card text-[#FF5E5B] transition-colors hover:border-[#FF5E5B] hover:bg-[#FF5E5B]/10 lg:flex" aria-label="Sponsoring" title="Sponsoring" href="/donate"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-heart-handshake size-[18px]"><path d="M19.5 12.572l-7.5 7.428l-7.5 -7.428a5 5 0 1 1 7.5 -6.566a5 5 0 1 1 7.5 6.572"></path><path d="M12 6l-3.293 3.293a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.414l.543 .543c.69 .69 1.81 .69 2.5 0l1 -1a3.182 3.182 0 0 1 4.5 0l2.25 2.25"></path><path d="M12.5 15.5l2 2"></path><path d="M15 13l2 2"></path></svg></a><button type="button" class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] border-[1.5px] border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary lg:hidden" aria-label="Open menu" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-slot="sheet-trigger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-menu-2 size-[18px]"><path d="M4 6l16 0"></path><path d="M4 12l16 0"></path><path d="M4 18l16 0"></path></svg></button></div></div></header></div><script>$RC("B:4","S:4")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:I[801462,[\"/_next/static/chunks/19q3t6c8ju5eh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2hn-s0-licsxf.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1dfthlj_ipn-y.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2uvfnzs39xe76.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/20zmbr5ri1n2k.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1t9axsn2ar1z1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2xw5h14zdvk_o.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1lou84w7jmmpn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xt1f4g31urai.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0ay72qqtrfa_y.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3te74nm7rzmxp.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3pv_a26qui2o0.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1xvuay8jhlfek.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0qkhg5pj2o8mc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2gv1meyrdcmzh.js\"],\"ScriptDetailPage\"]\n2a:T4ea,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"url\":\"https://community-scripts.org/scripts/ollama\",\"description\":\"Ollama is a tool that allows you to run large language models locally on your own computer. This means you can experiment with and use these AI models without needing an internet connection or relying on cloud-based services. It simplifies the process of managing and running these models, offering…\",\"image\":\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/selfhst/icons@main/webp/ollama.webp\",\"applicationCategory\":\"ServerApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Proxmox VE, Incus (Debian Linux)\",\"downloadUrl\":\"https://community-scripts.org/scripts/ollama\",\"installUrl\":\"https://community-scripts.org/scripts/ollama\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"license\":\"https://github.com/community-scripts/ProxmoxVE/blob/main/LICENSE\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"},\"softwareVersion\":\"v0.35.0\",\"codeRepository\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-29 00:00:00.000Z\",\"applicationSubCategory\":\"AI / Coding \u0026 Dev-Tools\",\"keywords\":\"AI / Coding \u0026 Dev-Tools\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Community Scripts\",\"url\":\"https://community-scripts.org\"}}2c:T7fd,## Decision models\r\n\r\nOllama now supports decision models through `/v1/systemone`, based on [TypeSafe’s Jev API](https://typesafe.ai).\r\n\r\nDecision models return choices, probabilities, and scores instead of text. Use them for tasks such as ticket triage, model routing, and content classification.\r\n\r\nAvailable models:\r\n- [**Nimble**](https://ollama.com/library/nimble) from Bespoke Labs\r\n- [**Tev1**](https://ollama.com/library/tev1) from Together AI\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nollama pull nimble\r\n```\r\n\r\nSend context and one or more questions:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\ncurl http://localhost:11434/v1/systemone \\\r\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\r\n  -d '{\r\n    \"model\": \"nimble\",\r\n    \"state\": \"Our checkout has returned 500 errors since 9am.\",\r\n    \"questions\": {\r\n      \"label\": {\r\n        \"type\": \"choice\",\r\n        \"instructions\": \"Which label fits this ticket?\",\r\n        \"criteria\": {\r\n          \"billing\": \"Payments and refunds\",\r\n          \"bug\": \"Software errors\",\r\n          \"account\": \"Login and account access\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }'\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample response:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"model\": \"nimble\",\r\n  \"answers\": {\r\n    \"label\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"choice\",\r\n      \"choice\": \"bug\",\r\n      \"probabilities\": {\r\n        \"billing\": 0.0125,\r\n        \"bug\": 0.9781,\r\n        \"account\": 0.0093\r\n      },\r\n      \"confidence\": 0.8906\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"usage\": {\r\n    \"input_tokens\": 174,\r\n    \"output_tokens\": 1\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe API supports three question types:\r\n- `choice`: Select an option and return probabilities for each.\r\n- `noul`: Return the probability that a condition is true.\r\n- `score`: Return a score across an ordered set of criteria\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n- Settings now opens without waiting for model discovery.\r\n- Fixed the macOS update menu and icon not reflecting an available update at startup.\r\n- Fixed stalled MLX model downloads hanging indefinitely.\r\n- Requests containing the deprecated `typical_p` parameter now log a warning instead of failing.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog:** https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.4...v0.35.022:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2a\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"scriptData\":{\"script\":{\"app_vars\":null,\"architectures\":[\"amd64\",\"arm64\"],\"categories\":[\"scriptcat00020\"],\"collectionId\":\"pbc_1280174292\",\"collectionName\":\"script_scripts\",\"created\":\"2026-02-16 00:00:00.000Z\",\"default_passwd\":\"\",\"default_user\":\"\",\"deleted_message\":\"\",\"description\":\"Ollama is a tool that allows you to run large language models locally on your own computer. This means you can experiment with and use these AI models without needing an internet connection or relying on cloud-based services. It simplifies the process of managing and running these models, offering a way to keep your data private and potentially work faster. 1  You can use Ollama to create local chatbots, conduct AI research, develop privacy-focused AI applications, and integrate AI into existing systems.\",\"disable_message\":\"\",\"documentation\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/tree/main/docs\",\"execute_in\":[\"pve\"],\"expand\":{\"categories\":[{\"collectionId\":\"pbc_1347592073\",\"collectionName\":\"script_categories\",\"created\":\"2026-02-16 00:00:00.000Z\",\"description\":\"AI services, development environments, and developer tooling.\",\"icon\":\"code\",\"id\":\"scriptcat00020\",\"name\":\"AI / Coding \u0026 Dev-Tools\",\"sort_order\":23,\"updated\":\"2026-08-27 05:48:20.874Z\"}],\"type\":{\"collectionId\":\"pbc_1651434153\",\"collectionName\":\"z_ref_script_types\",\"created\":\"2026-02-16 14:11:02.543Z\",\"id\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"type\":\"lxc\",\"updated\":\"2026-02-16 14:11:02.543Z\"}},\"has_arm\":true,\"id\":\"ollama000000000\",\"install_methods\":[{\"type\":\"default\",\"script\":null,\"config_path\":\"/usr/local/lib/ollama\",\"resources\":{\"cpu\":4,\"hdd\":40,\"os\":\"Ubuntu\",\"ram\":4096,\"version\":\"24.04\"}}],\"is_deleted\":false,\"is_dev\":false,\"is_disabled\":false,\"last_update_commit\":\"https://github.com/community-scripts/ProxmoxVE/pull/17585\",\"logo\":\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/selfhst/icons@main/webp/ollama.webp\",\"name\":\"Ollama\",\"notes\":[],\"pin_reason\":\"\",\"platforms\":[\"pve\",\"incus\"],\"port\":11434,\"privileged\":false,\"repository\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama\",\"repository_data\":{\"version\":\"v0.35.0\",\"changelog\":\"## Decision models\\r\\n\\r\\nOllama now supports decision models through `/v1/systemone`, based on [TypeSafe’s Jev API](https://typesafe.ai).\\r\\n\\r\\nDecision models return choices, probabilities, and scores instead of text. Use them for tasks such as ticket triage, model routing, and content classification.\\r\\n\\r\\nAvailable models:\\r\\n- [**Nimble**](https://ollama.com/library/nimble) from Bespoke Labs\\r\\n- [**Tev1**](https://ollama.com/library/tev1) from Together AI\\r\\n\\r\\n```sh\\r\\nollama pull nimble\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nSend conte…\",\"github_synced_at\":\"2026-10-01T22:14:55.862Z\"},\"script_created\":\"2025-04-30 00:00:00.000Z\",\"script_updated\":\"2026-09-29 00:00:00.000Z\",\"slug\":\"ollama\",\"type\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"updateable\":true,\"updated\":\"2026-10-01 22:14:55.868Z\",\"website\":\"https://ollama.com/\"},\"releases\":[{\"tag_name\":\"v0.35.1-rc0\",\"name\":\"v0.35.1\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-29T20:14:22Z\",\"body\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n* feat: allow ten web searches per response by @ParthSareen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18602\\r\\n* MLX: version bump by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18651\\r\\n* llama.cpp: version bump b11232 by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18652\\r\\n* create: support explicit model capabilities by @dhiltgen in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/18708\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.35.0...v0.35.1-rc0\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.1-rc0\",\"prerelease\":true},{\"tag_name\":\"v0.35.0\",\"name\":\"v0.35.0\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-28T21:23:22Z\",\"body\":\"$2c\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.0\",\"prerelease\":false},{\"tag_name\":\"v0.40.0-rc0\",\"name\":\"v0.40.0\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-25T03:31:52Z\",\"body\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n**Models run on MLX on Apple Silicon by default**\\r\\n\\r\\nIn this release, on Apple Silicon devices, model architectures supported by the MLX runtime will automatically run on MLX.\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\nollama pull qwen3.8\\r\\nollama run qwen3.8\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nDuring the pre-release we will be testing and enabling additional models.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.4...v0.40.0-rc0\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.0-rc0\",\"prerelease\":true},{\"tag_name\":\"v0.34.4\",\"name\":\"v0.34.4\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-23T02:24:43Z\",\"body\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n- Structured outputs on thinking models now apply in a single pass, making them faster and more reliable.\\r\\n- Fixed intermittent \\\"model not found\\\" errors with a large local library\\r\\n- Fixed the macOS app becoming unresponsive when checking if ChatGPT or Codex is running.\\r\\n- Qwen 3.8 prompt processing is faster on Apple Silicon.\\r\\n- Gemma 4 on Apple Silicon now picks the best image resolution per image, keeping more detail in high-resolution images.\\r\\n- Updated llama.cpp, MLX, and XGrammar.\\r\\n \\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.3...v0.34.4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.4\",\"prerelease\":false},{\"tag_name\":\"v0.34.3\",\"name\":\"v0.34.3\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-19T00:02:57Z\",\"body\":\"## What's Changed\\r\\n\\r\\n`GET /api/show` now advertises each model's thinking controls and default:\\r\\n\\r\\nAvailable in the CLI with:\\r\\n```\\r\\nollama show gemma4\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n    thinking\\r\\n        levels     false, true\\r\\n        default    true\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nAvailable in the API with:\\r\\n```sh \\r\\ncurl http://localhost:11434/api/show -d '{\\\"model\\\": \\\"glm-5.3-flash:cloud\\\"}'\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n```json\\r\\n{\\r\\n  \\\"thinking\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"values\\\": [\\\"low\\\", \\\"high\\\", \\\"max\\\"],\\r\\n    \\\"default\\\": \\\"max\\\"\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nAlso available on ollama.com directly for cloud models.\\r\\n\\r\\n* **Nemotron H** vision models are now supported on Apple Silicon with MLX\\r\\n* Ollama's macOS app will now no longer reopen windows you've closed when activating it\\r\\n* Fix for model pulls from HuggingFace\\r\\n\\r\\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.34.2...v0.34.3\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.34.3\",\"prerelease\":false}],\"latestStable\":{\"tag_name\":\"v0.35.0\",\"name\":\"v0.35.0\",\"published_at\":\"2026-09-28T21:23:22Z\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.35.0\"},\"screenshots\":[],\"pinnedVersion\":null,\"breakingChanges\":[],\"needsSync\":false},\"similarScripts\":[{\"name\":\"Gitea Runner\",\"script_updated\":\"2026-09-29 00:00:00.000Z\",\"slug\":\"gitea-runner\",\"categories\":[\"scriptcat00020\"],\"created\":\"2026-09-29 11:17:08.578Z\",\"execute_in\":[\"lxc\"],\"id\":\"c0mbfrqmd8ujoiw\",\"logo\":\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/selfhst/icons@main/webp/gitea.webp\",\"privileged\":false,\"architectures\":[\"amd64\",\"arm64\"],\"description\":\"Gitea Runner (act_runner) is the daemon that executes CI/CD jobs for Gitea Actions. It connects to your Gitea instance, polls for queued workflow runs, and executes tasks using either host execution or containerized engines.\",\"is_deleted\":false,\"script_created\":\"2026-09-24 00:00:00.000Z\",\"type\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"expand\":{\"categories\":[{\"collectionName\":\"script_categories\",\"icon\":\"code\",\"id\":\"scriptcat00020\",\"name\":\"AI / Coding \u0026 Dev-Tools\",\"updated\":\"2026-08-27 05:48:20.874Z\",\"collectionId\":\"pbc_1347592073\",\"created\":\"2026-02-16 00:00:00.000Z\",\"description\":\"AI services, development environments, and developer tooling.\",\"sort_order\":23}],\"type\":{\"id\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"type\":\"lxc\"}},\"is_dev\":true,\"is_disabled\":false,\"updateable\":true,\"platforms\":[],\"updated\":\"2026-09-29 11:43:42.099Z\",\"install_command\":\"var_os='debian' bash -c \\\"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/community-scripts/ProxmoxVED/main/ct/gitea-runner.sh)\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"LocalAI\",\"created\":\"2026-09-18 06:54:43.960Z\",\"id\":\"3w7bt3ce9v2w9wv\",\"is_disabled\":false,\"architectures\":[],\"description\":\"LocalAI is a drop-in replacement for the OpenAI API that runs entirely on your own hardware. One binary serves text generation, image generation, speech-to-text and text-to-speech behind OpenAI-compatible endpoints, backed by a model gallery and pluggable inference backends. Heavier than llama.cpp, but multi-modal and self-managing.\",\"script_updated\":\"2026-09-18 00:00:00.000Z\",\"type\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"updateable\":true,\"execute_in\":[\"lxc\"],\"expand\":{\"categories\":[{\"collectionName\":\"script_categories\",\"created\":\"2026-02-16 00:00:00.000Z\",\"description\":\"AI services, development environments, and developer tooling.\",\"icon\":\"code\",\"id\":\"scriptcat00020\",\"collectionId\":\"pbc_1347592073\",\"name\":\"AI / Coding \u0026 Dev-Tools\",\"sort_order\":23,\"updated\":\"2026-08-27 05:48:20.874Z\"}],\"type\":{\"id\":\"nm9bra8mzye2scg\",\"type\":\"lxc\"}},\"is_deleted\":false,\"is_dev\":true,\"logo\":\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/selfhst/icons@main/webp/localai.webp\",\"privileged\":false,\"categories\":[\"scriptcat00020\"],\"script_created\":\"2026-08-24 00:00:00.000Z\",\"slug\":\"localai\",\"platforms\":[],\"updated\":\"2026-10-01 21:38:08.341Z\",\"install_command\":\"bash -c \\\"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/community-scripts/ProxmoxVED/main/ct/localai.sh)\\\"\"},{\"architectures\":[\"amd64\",\"arm64\"],\"slug\":\"openviking\",\"updateable\":true,\"platforms\":[],\"is_deleted\":false,\"updated\"